Add a Dockerized ASTRYX observer for federated Stacks libp2p topology, propagation, signer-quorum, synchronization, pressure, and stall evidence, including a bounded privacy-preserving edge reporter that projects live libp2p PoC diagnostics into the dashboard. Identity-bearing signer-round diagnostics require the explicit `network_observer` build feature; the PoC enables it and supports restart-safe persisted regtest tips by resuming the active VRF registration, discarding stale pending commits, and never advancing Bitcoin ahead of the node or signers.
